###
POST {{llm-uri}}/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
x-litellm-api-key: {{lite-llm-key}}

{
  "model": "Intel/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B-int4-AutoRound",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hello"
    }
  ]
}

### Streaming with timings_per_token — llama.cpp omits timings on a stream unless this is set
POST {{llm-uri}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
x-litellm-api-key: {{lite-llm-key}}

{
  "model": "qwen3.8",
  "stream": true,
  "stream_options": {
    "include_usage": true
  },
  "timings_per_token": true,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hello"
    }
  ]
}

###